        <detaileddescription>
<para>Class for splitting text into words</para>
<para>This tokenizer will break down a string into sub-strings (i.e words) separated by the given separator characters. If the string contains certain known UTF-8 characters they will be replaced by their ASCII equivalents processing the string.</para>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst

*See also*
   :cpp:class:`ValueTokenizer`, :cpp:func:`utils::split_words`, :cpp:func:`utils::utf8_subst`</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>str</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>string to be processed </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>_separators</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>string with separator characters (default: &quot; \t\r\n\f&quot;) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
